Subject: [PATCH 65/97] XMP custom music phase 1: XamCreateEnumeratorHandle for
 app 0xFA lists <exe>/music (xmp_music_dir) as 820-byte song records; 0x70025
 ok; 0x7003B logged play request; rate-limited XMP message log

Verified in WWE '13 entrance editor: USER PLAYLIST shows the folder songs, pick survives save/reload.

